{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Prometheus data source",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "description": "SmartScale AI — Cost savings analysis: Scale-to-Zero vs Always-On",
  "editable": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "💰 Cost Analysis",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "title": "Time at Zero Replicas (Hours)",
      "description": "Total hours the deployment was scaled to 0 pods.\nEvery hour at 0 = $0.00 compute cost.\nWith standard HPA (min=1): this would cost $0.0104/hr per t3.micro.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "h",
          "decimals": 1
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum_over_time((kube_deployment_status_replicas{deployment=\"keda-demo\", namespace=\"keda-demo\"} == bool 0)[24h:1m]) / 60",
          "legendFormat": "Hours at Zero",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Time with Active Pods (Hours)",
      "description": "Total hours at least 1 pod was running.\nThis is the billable compute time.\nWith KEDA scale-to-zero: we only pay during these hours.",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              { "color": "yellow", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 12 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "h",
          "decimals": 1
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum_over_time((kube_deployment_status_replicas{deployment=\"keda-demo\", namespace=\"keda-demo\"} > bool 0)[24h:1m]) / 60",
          "legendFormat": "Hours Active",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Cost Comparison (24h Estimate)",
      "description": "Estimated daily cost comparison:\n  Always-On (1 pod × 24h): baseline\n  KEDA Scale-to-Zero: pay only for active hours\n  Spot + KEDA: additional 70% savings on compute\n\nPricing: t3.micro = $0.0104/hr On-Demand, ~$0.0031/hr Spot",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 4
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Strategy" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "string" }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "vector(0.2496)",
          "legendFormat": "Always-On (HPA min=1)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum_over_time((kube_deployment_status_replicas{deployment=\"keda-demo\", namespace=\"keda-demo\"} > bool 0)[24h:1m]) / 60 * 0.0104",
          "legendFormat": "KEDA Scale-to-Zero (On-Demand)",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum_over_time((kube_deployment_status_replicas{deployment=\"keda-demo\", namespace=\"keda-demo\"} > bool 0)[24h:1m]) / 60 * 0.0031",
          "legendFormat": "KEDA + Spot Instances",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Replica Count Over Time (24h)",
      "description": "Shows scaling events over the last 24 hours.\nFlat at 0 = idle (no cost).\nSpikes = traffic bursts being processed.\nNarrow spikes = fast processing (good).\nWide plateaus = sustained load.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "fixedColor": "blue", "mode": "fixed" },
          "custom": {
            "axisLabel": "Pod Count",
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": { "mode": "none" }
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 6
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 7 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "kube_deployment_status_replicas{deployment=\"keda-demo\", namespace=\"keda-demo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Active Replicas",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Savings Summary",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Cost Savings Model\n\n| Strategy | Daily Cost | Monthly Cost | Annual Cost | Savings |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **Always-On** (HPA min=1, On-Demand) | $0.25 | $7.49 | $91.10 | Baseline |\n| **KEDA Scale-to-Zero** (On-Demand) | ~$0.05 | ~$1.50 | ~$18.22 | **80%** |\n| **KEDA + Spot Instances** | ~$0.015 | ~$0.45 | ~$5.47 | **94%** |\n\n> Assumes 80% idle time (typical for event-driven workloads with bursty traffic patterns).\n> Spot pricing: t3.micro ~$0.0031/hr (70% discount vs $0.0104/hr On-Demand).\n> Scale-to-Zero: pods run only during the 20% active window."
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "style": "dark",
  "tags": ["smartscale-ai", "cost", "finops"],
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
  "title": "SmartScale AI — Cost Savings",
  "uid": "smartscale-cost",
  "version": 1
}
